{"schema_version":1,"key":"garlic-shrimp","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-4a879c3b12a8","name":"蒜蓉虾","category":"aquatic","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/aquatic/%E8%92%9C%E8%93%89%E8%99%BE/%E8%92%9C%E8%93%89%E8%99%BE.md","blob_sha":"318d762f322537d1a79820027a10309f69667378","details":{"introduction":"这道广东传统名菜以鲜香嫩滑著称，虾肉清甜弹牙，蒜香浓郁扑鼻。海虾富含优质蛋白和钙、硒等微量元素，搭配蒜蓉有助杀菌开胃。做法十分简单，处理虾、铺酱、蒸制、淋油几步即成，新手也能轻松驾驭，全程约需 15 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"* 海虾\n* 蒜蓉酱\n* 食用油\n* 生抽"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n* 海虾 8 只\n* 蒜蓉酱 50 g\n* 食用油 20 ml\n* 生抽 5 ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 用刀从虾头中间切开，切到距离虾尾 1 cm\n2. 将蒜蓉酱铺在虾身中间，放在盘子中\n3. 锅中倒入热水，将盘子放入锅中，大火蒸 3 分钟\n4. 烧热油，倒入虾盘中，倒入生抽"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去壳生虾仁350g、去皮大蒜35g、小葱10g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）15g、大豆食用油15g、食盐2g；整份约400g。虾去头去壳去肠净虾仁，蒸汁和油酱全食。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":123.35,"protein_g":18.495,"carbohydrate_g":3.264625,"fat_g":4.266125},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/175179/nutrients","version":"8566b9fcb9144ce3","fdc_ids":[175179,169230,170005,174277,171411,173468]},"profile_id":"family-4a879c3b12a8-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-4a879c3b12a8","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-4a879c3b12a8","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"covered_steaming","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-4a879c3b12a8-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"shrimp","grams":350},{"key":"garlic","grams":35},{"key":"scallion","grams":10},{"key":"soy","grams":15},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料",